# Netlify response headers — https://docs.netlify.com/routing/headers/
# Baseline hardening for a static editorial site. No CSP yet: article embeds
# (Instagram/TikTok) would need a maintained allowlist — add one deliberately,
# not here.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
